<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz adds 100 mln Sfr to 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz adds 100 mln Sfr to 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 250 million Swiss francs from 100 million Swiss francs, lead manager UBS said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ GZ</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.0	 MATURITY    27.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.15     PAY DATE    18.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STD	 LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   25.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	PLUS 108 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
